{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object detected, grab and process it. Move to destination. If destination reached, scan for objects. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInRange    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Condition ID = IsDestinationReached    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    />",
